        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 231.03,
          "end": 232.92000000000002,
          "en": "And of course, as always for that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 232.92000000000002,
          "end": 234.93,
          "en": "you should make sure that you import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 234.93,
          "end": 238.353,
          "en": "this MealItemTrait.dart file in which we just worked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 239.297,
          "end": 244.034,
          "en": "And then here we can set an icon and then a label.",
