        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 248.971,
          "end": 253.17,
          "en": "And for that, I think the schedule icon is quite good,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 253.17,
          "end": 255.573,
          "en": "because that's this little clock icon here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 256.926,
          "end": 260.392,
          "en": "Well, and then the label is the meal duration,",
